Package: GraphLearnR
Type: Package
Title: Graph Learning with External Regressors
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Shivam", "Pawar", 
                  email = "sgpawar@csuchico.edu",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  comment = c(ORCID = "YOUR-ORCID-ID"))
Description: Implements the Graph Learning with External Regressors (GLReg) 
    algorithm for learning graph Laplacian structure from noisy signal 
    observations. Based on the methodology from Guo, Moses, and Wang (2023).
    Supports graph signal processing with external regressors to improve
    structure learning under missing data. Includes tools for synthetic
    graph generation, signal generation, and performance evaluation.
